Objective 1: OS Fingerprinting
Command:   sudo nmap -O 192.168.1.10
        

Objective 2: SNMP System Information- Enumerate the system management subtree over SNMP
Command:   snmpwalk -v2c -c public 192.168.1.10 system
           

Objective 3: SNMP Interface Enumeration- Enumerate the SNMP interface table
Command:
           snmpwalk -v2c -c public 192.168.1.10 ifTable
